<title>SWEDEN: Stora says buys Polish paper wholesaler.</title>
<headline>Stora says buys Polish paper wholesaler.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group Stora said on Thursday its Paper Merchant division had acquired all of the shares in the Polish paper wholesaler PN Papier.</p>
<p>The wholesaler is the largest in the Poznan region, and has a turnover of 70 million crowns, Stora said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition is part of Stora Merchant's strategy to acquire significant wholesalers in eastern Europe,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1003</p>
